WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:38.640
MOONLIGHT HEIGHTS

01:38.720 --> 01:39.720
Mr. Gao.

01:40.600 --> 01:42.600
Did you come all the way here

01:42.680 --> 01:44.280
for my daughter's birthday party?

01:45.360 --> 01:47.080
I'm sorry. It's a pity.

01:47.680 --> 01:48.760
The banquet has just ended.

01:49.520 --> 01:50.600
To tell you the truth,

01:51.160 --> 01:54.040
I've come to ask you for someone.

01:56.680 --> 01:59.560
Who can make you make such a request?

02:00.600 --> 02:03.840
Just a spirit slave here,
as long as Mr. Gao agrees

02:03.920 --> 02:05.960
to open the Spirit Lock.

02:06.720 --> 02:08.000
No problem.

02:08.639 --> 02:11.360
You can take any spirit slave you want,

02:12.160 --> 02:14.480
but I'm sorry

02:14.560 --> 02:16.960
you've come so far

02:17.040 --> 02:18.120
and missed

02:18.200 --> 02:20.360
my daughter's birthday party,

02:21.120 --> 02:23.800
so you can stay here for a few days

02:23.880 --> 02:26.400
to let me play a good host.

02:27.280 --> 02:28.440
You are too kind, Mr. Gao,

02:28.960 --> 02:30.920
but there are many
pressing matters in Snow City,

02:31.600 --> 02:33.440
and my father needs me,
so I dare not delay.

02:33.520 --> 02:34.880
I beg your pardon.

02:36.200 --> 02:39.080
Is Snow City in any trouble?

02:39.800 --> 02:42.680
If you need our help,

02:42.760 --> 02:44.200
let me know.

02:44.840 --> 02:48.120
We, the Immortal Alliance,
are in the same boat,

02:48.200 --> 02:50.600
so we should help each other.

02:53.320 --> 02:55.520
That's just Snow City's private business.

02:55.600 --> 02:56.560
I don't want to bother you.

02:57.840 --> 02:59.040
So, when will you

02:59.120 --> 03:00.960
unlock the Spirit Lock?

03:02.640 --> 03:03.800
Don't worry.

03:03.880 --> 03:05.360
Please wait a moment.

03:05.440 --> 03:08.240
I'll ask someone to fetch
the key to Spirit Lock.

03:09.840 --> 03:10.880
Thank you.

03:12.600 --> 03:14.880
I'll wait in the courtyard.

03:14.960 --> 03:17.000
OK.

03:29.080 --> 03:30.200
Ask Supervisor Dai to investigate

03:31.040 --> 03:32.840
which spirit slave

03:33.720 --> 03:35.640
Xie Xuechen is interested in.

03:35.720 --> 03:36.640
Yes, sir.

03:37.160 --> 03:40.080
The spirit slave must be special

03:40.160 --> 03:42.240
to make someone
like Xie Xuechen interested.

03:42.840 --> 03:44.320
In this way,

03:44.400 --> 03:46.440
I can change Ling's future destiny.

03:47.400 --> 03:48.560
Ling.

03:51.240 --> 03:52.560
Ling.

03:56.880 --> 03:57.800
Ling.

03:57.880 --> 04:00.280
CLEAR AS MOONLIGHT

04:00.360 --> 04:02.320
You know
it's the Master's daughter's birthday,

04:02.920 --> 04:04.600
but you've been missing all day.

04:05.120 --> 04:07.080
You were not only slacking off

04:07.160 --> 04:08.800
but also stealing.

04:09.400 --> 04:11.960
That was a gift from my Mister.
I didn't steal it.

04:12.720 --> 04:14.080
Miss Gao.

04:14.160 --> 04:15.400
She stole this.

04:16.200 --> 04:17.519
These are not my clothes.

04:23.840 --> 04:25.000
It's getting late.

04:25.640 --> 04:27.040
If you've finished punishing her,

04:27.120 --> 04:28.600
take her away.

04:28.680 --> 04:29.520
Don't disturb my rest.

04:31.640 --> 04:33.120
Good night, Miss Gao.

04:34.800 --> 04:36.640
Even if you didn't steal from her,

04:36.720 --> 04:38.120
you stole from someone else.

04:38.200 --> 04:39.440
Thief.

04:41.320 --> 04:42.360
Really?

04:42.880 --> 04:44.520
How dare you push me?

04:49.320 --> 04:50.960
I didn't expect you

04:51.480 --> 04:52.600
to be so tough.

04:54.880 --> 04:56.040
Supervisor.

04:57.120 --> 04:58.040
What's up?

04:58.560 --> 04:59.720
Mr. Gao wants to tell you

05:00.360 --> 05:01.640
that Snow City's Lord

05:01.720 --> 05:03.160
has his eye on one of our spirit slaves,

05:03.240 --> 05:04.880
so he wants you to secretly find out

05:04.960 --> 05:06.320
who that spirit slave is.

05:06.920 --> 05:08.720
The young man in the morning

05:09.240 --> 05:10.960
was Xie Xuechen,

05:11.560 --> 05:14.280
so the spirit slave he had his eye on…

05:34.320 --> 05:35.520
Sang Qi?

05:36.040 --> 05:37.160
He comes so fast.

05:38.440 --> 05:39.560
Ling.

05:40.640 --> 05:41.840
Mister.

05:41.920 --> 05:43.280
Where are you?

05:43.800 --> 05:45.640
When will you come back and take me away?

05:47.160 --> 05:49.080
Come on. Come on.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.600
What happened?

05:51.280 --> 05:52.640
-Miss Gao.
-Run.

05:57.120 --> 05:58.720
-Miss Gao.
-Miss Gao.

06:21.960 --> 06:23.480
Is this the Gao family's daughter?

06:47.880 --> 06:49.240
Ling.

06:50.400 --> 06:52.600
Ling. Ling.

06:52.680 --> 06:53.560
CLEAR AS MOONLIGHT

07:02.600 --> 07:03.840
She was here.

07:08.600 --> 07:10.480
Your spirit is severely damaged.

07:10.560 --> 07:12.680
If you force time travel again,

07:13.400 --> 07:14.880
you may not be able to return.

07:38.320 --> 07:40.160
Who else is not afraid of death?

07:48.040 --> 07:49.000
Don't be afraid.

07:49.720 --> 07:50.760
It's all right.

07:52.720 --> 07:54.080
I'm taking you away now.

07:59.880 --> 08:01.760
Thank you for saving my life.

08:02.320 --> 08:04.720
Are you the Lord of Snow City,

08:05.760 --> 08:07.040
Xie Xuechen?

08:08.120 --> 08:09.400
Why you?

08:12.720 --> 08:14.440
Why are you wearing her clothes?

08:16.280 --> 08:19.160
Miss Gao. Demons have stormed
the lodge and massacred us.

08:19.240 --> 08:20.800
We can't stay here.

08:20.880 --> 08:21.920
Supervisor Dai.

08:22.000 --> 08:24.160
Find a slave who resembles Miss Gao

08:24.240 --> 08:25.720
and dress her in Miss Gao's clothes.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.280
I'll take her and distract
the Golden Tiger Warrior.

08:27.360 --> 08:29.640
Get Miss Gao out of here with Elder Hua.

08:32.760 --> 08:35.960
When I was a child, you died for me,

08:37.039 --> 08:38.360
and I owed you,

08:38.440 --> 08:39.520
so today,

08:40.039 --> 08:41.720
I'm paying you back.

08:44.800 --> 08:46.440
So, that's what you mean

08:47.840 --> 08:49.120
by "die for you".

08:51.000 --> 08:52.160
Where is Ling?

08:53.400 --> 08:54.240
Where did Ling go?

08:54.840 --> 08:56.080
Elder…

08:56.160 --> 08:57.680
Elder Song took her away.

08:57.760 --> 08:59.080
Where did he take her?

09:00.320 --> 09:01.800
I left first,

09:02.320 --> 09:04.560
so I don't know where they went.

09:09.360 --> 09:11.560
From there, we can leave here.

09:12.440 --> 09:13.560
Let's escape together.

09:14.400 --> 09:15.480
If you can escape,

09:17.080 --> 09:18.400
do it alone,

09:21.760 --> 09:22.800
but remember

09:24.360 --> 09:26.960
that sacrificing others to save yourself
is never the right thing to do.

09:27.920 --> 09:29.000
Gao Qiumin.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.480
Don't become
that kind of person in the future.

09:40.640 --> 09:42.560
It's dangerous inside.

09:42.640 --> 09:45.080
They must have led their pursuers
in the opposite direction.

09:45.160 --> 09:45.960
Ling.

09:46.040 --> 09:47.640
-This way.
-I'm coming.

09:49.760 --> 09:50.600
Stand still.

09:56.320 --> 09:57.320
I'm not the daughter of the Gao family.

09:57.920 --> 09:59.120
You're mistaken.

09:59.880 --> 10:01.280
Spirit slave?

10:01.360 --> 10:02.680
We've been tricked by this old man.

10:02.760 --> 10:05.120
The old man pretended
to protect her to lure us in.

10:05.200 --> 10:06.720
They played it so well.

10:07.560 --> 10:08.680
Then I'll kill her.

10:28.120 --> 10:29.480
-Mister.
-Ling.

10:30.800 --> 10:33.440
Mister. Mister,
you finally came to save me.

10:33.520 --> 10:36.000
I told you I'd take you away.

10:36.600 --> 10:37.600
Go.

10:47.240 --> 10:48.360
How are you hurt?

10:48.880 --> 10:50.200
Mister.

10:50.280 --> 10:51.400
I'm fine.

10:51.920 --> 10:53.000
Really.

10:57.120 --> 10:58.160
Let's go.

11:08.920 --> 11:10.240
Mister.

11:11.920 --> 11:13.280
Mister.

11:17.640 --> 11:20.880
Mister, are you okay?

11:20.960 --> 11:22.360
I'm fine.

11:23.320 --> 11:24.160
Don't be afraid.

11:32.200 --> 11:34.840
Ling. Don't be afraid.

11:34.920 --> 11:37.520
Why are the demonic patterns on her face
exactly like the sacred patterns

11:37.600 --> 11:39.040
on the Chaos Pearl?

11:39.120 --> 11:41.480
-So…
-Did it hurt?

11:42.320 --> 11:43.240
No,

11:43.960 --> 11:45.000
not at all.

11:47.040 --> 11:47.920
Mister.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.840
I'll be with you

11:50.920 --> 11:52.240
wherever you go from now on.

11:55.720 --> 11:58.360
No wonder Xie Xuechen
asked me for a spirit slave.

11:59.000 --> 12:00.840
He's coveting the Chaos Pearl.

12:02.240 --> 12:03.640
Xie Xuechen.

12:05.080 --> 12:06.680
Give her to me.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.520
What do you mean?

12:13.040 --> 12:14.960
Where's the Spirit Lock key
I asked you for?

12:16.760 --> 12:18.840
Do you still want to play games with me?

12:19.880 --> 12:21.440
I wondered at first

12:21.520 --> 12:24.880
why you asked me

12:24.960 --> 12:27.480
for an insignificant spirit slave,

12:27.560 --> 12:29.680
but until I saw her face,

12:29.760 --> 12:31.120
I realized

12:31.200 --> 12:33.160
this is

12:33.680 --> 12:35.320
what you want.

12:35.400 --> 12:37.880
My nephew. Give her to me.

12:45.640 --> 12:46.880
My spirit is damaged,

12:48.000 --> 12:49.520
and I don't know
how much longer I can last,

12:50.480 --> 12:51.920
so I can't waste my time here
with Gao Fengxu.

12:54.640 --> 12:55.640
Ling.

12:56.240 --> 12:57.200
Wait for me.

12:58.280 --> 12:59.720
I'm going to grab the key to Spirit Lock.

13:01.000 --> 13:02.080
Mister.

13:04.880 --> 13:05.760
Leave me alone.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.920
I'm actually here for you.

13:18.200 --> 13:19.360
My nephew.

13:19.960 --> 13:22.520
You're at the end of your rope,

13:23.120 --> 13:24.880
so I'm afraid you can't
even withstand one of my attacks.

13:25.720 --> 13:27.120
As long as you give her to me,

13:27.720 --> 13:29.520
I can forget about your conspiracy

13:29.600 --> 13:31.400
with Sang Qi to take the Pearl

13:33.200 --> 13:34.680
and your attack on this place.

13:37.600 --> 13:39.560
I think you should know better than me

13:39.640 --> 13:41.800
why Sang Qi chose today to attack.

13:43.080 --> 13:44.480
You are
the Immortal Alliance's Grandmaster,

13:45.120 --> 13:47.200
yet you are greedy
for treasures and power.

13:47.840 --> 13:51.640
A heartless man like you
doesn't deserve her.

13:51.720 --> 13:52.640
You…

13:53.480 --> 13:55.960
It seems you don't need my mercy.

13:57.800 --> 13:59.080
Mister.

14:00.160 --> 14:02.360
Mister. Mister.

14:02.440 --> 14:04.400
Mister, are you alright?

14:15.240 --> 14:17.160
Mister, are you alright?

14:18.160 --> 14:19.240
Give her to me,

14:19.960 --> 14:21.640
and I'll spare your life.

14:32.640 --> 14:33.480
Don't be afraid.

14:34.600 --> 14:35.760
Close your eyes.

14:37.400 --> 14:39.080
When you open your eyes,

14:40.400 --> 14:41.440
everything will be fine.

14:42.120 --> 14:43.160
No.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.520
Good girl.

15:07.040 --> 15:08.320
Do as I say.

15:11.000 --> 15:12.560
Okay.

15:12.640 --> 15:15.000
Mister, I will.

15:36.880 --> 15:38.440
Stubborn.

15:59.080 --> 16:00.040
Are you going to destroy
your own spiritual channel?

17:03.400 --> 17:04.880
Mister.

17:06.319 --> 17:07.520
Mister.

17:07.599 --> 17:09.200
The Chaos Pearl.

17:12.319 --> 17:13.359
Mister.

17:16.359 --> 17:17.520
Mister.

17:18.079 --> 17:20.119
Mister, what happened to you?

17:28.600 --> 17:32.000
The Chaos Pearl.

17:33.240 --> 17:34.400
Mister.

17:35.040 --> 17:36.680
Mister.

17:40.520 --> 17:41.560
Ling.

17:44.200 --> 17:45.280
Ling.

17:48.000 --> 17:49.040
Now,

17:50.480 --> 17:52.560
go open the Spirit Lock.

17:53.640 --> 17:56.000
Sang Qi.

17:56.080 --> 17:57.440
Sang Qi is coming.

17:58.600 --> 18:00.160
Now. Now.

18:00.240 --> 18:02.120
We'll go together.

18:02.840 --> 18:05.760
You said you'd take me with you.

18:05.840 --> 18:07.280
You can't lie to me.

18:08.320 --> 18:11.000
I don't want to be alone.

18:19.040 --> 18:20.720
Mister.

18:20.800 --> 18:22.560
Mister, don't die.

18:22.640 --> 18:24.280
Please.

18:31.240 --> 18:32.720
Don't die.

18:43.360 --> 18:45.800
Mister.

18:48.800 --> 18:50.440
Mister.

18:57.240 --> 18:58.360
Mister.

18:59.280 --> 19:01.400
Mister, wake up.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.360
Mister.

19:07.120 --> 19:08.560
Mister.

19:13.360 --> 19:15.040
Mister.

19:16.000 --> 19:17.560
I'm just

19:17.640 --> 19:18.840
a spirit slave,

19:18.920 --> 19:19.800
and no one has ever

19:20.600 --> 19:22.600
cared for me or loved me, except you.

19:23.440 --> 19:26.520
You said you'd take me away,
and I believed you.

19:27.200 --> 19:28.520
Ling.

19:29.240 --> 19:31.080
I wasn't upset

19:31.160 --> 19:33.280
when they beat me

19:33.800 --> 19:35.680
-because I thought
-Ling.

19:35.760 --> 19:37.920
you'd take me away soon.

19:40.920 --> 19:41.960
Ling.

19:42.040 --> 19:42.920
Ling. Leave me alone.

19:43.680 --> 19:44.880
Get out of here.

20:05.600 --> 20:06.640
This is…

20:07.680 --> 20:08.600
The Chaos Power.

20:37.440 --> 20:39.400
Ling. Don't do this.

20:39.480 --> 20:41.280
Don't lose your Chaos Power.

20:41.360 --> 20:42.440
Ling.

21:00.200 --> 21:01.280
So…

21:03.920 --> 21:05.040
So…

21:07.000 --> 21:09.480
So, you saved me with the Chaos Power.

21:28.360 --> 21:29.600
You were lucky

21:30.760 --> 21:32.080
to die like that.

21:39.760 --> 21:41.280
If you're so sad,

21:41.360 --> 21:42.720
join him.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.280
Ling.

21:49.320 --> 21:51.760
I can't die.

22:04.720 --> 22:05.560
Do you want revenge?

22:08.320 --> 22:09.200
I can help you,

22:10.640 --> 22:13.680
no matter who you want to take revenge on.

22:14.960 --> 22:16.040
Moonlight Heights,

22:16.760 --> 22:17.720
the Immortal Alliance,

22:17.800 --> 22:18.920
the Humans,

22:20.160 --> 22:21.120
or even

22:22.840 --> 22:23.840
me.

22:25.960 --> 22:26.960
Ling.

22:27.480 --> 22:29.160
Don't trust him. Don't go with him.

22:49.680 --> 22:50.840
Ling.

23:01.840 --> 23:03.080
Ling.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.560
Don't.

23:07.360 --> 23:09.560
Ling. Don't.

23:10.280 --> 23:11.160
Come back.

23:17.760 --> 23:19.880
Ling. Don't.

23:21.120 --> 23:22.360
Don't.

23:22.440 --> 23:24.080
Your spirit can't hold out much longer.

23:24.160 --> 23:26.040
Do you really want to die here?

23:28.560 --> 23:29.760
Dad?

24:00.720 --> 24:02.960
There's no time. You must leave.

24:20.000 --> 24:21.760
I went back so many times

24:23.080 --> 24:25.160
just so she could be safe,

24:26.800 --> 24:28.000
but in the end,

24:29.480 --> 24:32.320
the little warmth I gave her

24:33.640 --> 24:36.360
turned into a lifetime of pain
that she couldn't forget

24:39.960 --> 24:41.520
and even killed her.

24:42.560 --> 24:43.520
Xie Xuechen.

24:44.600 --> 24:45.720
Ten years ago,

24:47.080 --> 24:49.040
I saw you in the samsara mirror.

24:51.280 --> 24:53.920
You knew I couldn't save her
even if I went back in time,

24:54.680 --> 24:56.640
but why did you purposely lure me back

24:56.720 --> 24:57.960
to the same mistake?

24:58.560 --> 24:59.960
Do you know

25:01.440 --> 25:02.880
what time is to me?

25:16.640 --> 25:18.320
The beginning is the end.

25:19.240 --> 25:20.840
The first is the last.

25:22.920 --> 25:25.040
I can go back and forth in time and space,

25:25.600 --> 25:26.840
but I am just an observer

25:27.800 --> 25:30.640
who cannot make any changes
to the past or the future.

25:32.080 --> 25:32.920
Likewise,

25:33.560 --> 25:35.200
for High Fate Divinity,

25:36.000 --> 25:37.680
it is the nature of fate.

25:38.720 --> 25:41.600
All endings are revealed
before the beginning,

25:43.160 --> 25:44.920
and all attempts to change destiny

25:45.800 --> 25:47.640
are destiny.

25:57.760 --> 25:59.120
What did I do wrong?

26:00.240 --> 26:01.800
What did Ling do wrong?

26:01.880 --> 26:04.120
Why do we have such a destiny?

26:06.800 --> 26:08.520
I don't understand fate either,

26:09.280 --> 26:10.920
but a man once told me

26:11.440 --> 26:12.880
to wait here for someone

26:13.680 --> 26:16.040
who would solve
the mystery of fate for me.

26:17.560 --> 26:18.480
I thought

26:19.840 --> 26:21.520
you were that person.

26:22.640 --> 26:24.280
You have the Chaos Power.

26:25.200 --> 26:26.360
The Chaos Power

26:26.440 --> 26:28.360
can reverse the outcome.

26:31.960 --> 26:33.520
But I can't even save Ling.

26:33.600 --> 26:34.760
You can.

26:38.400 --> 26:40.600
The Chaos Pearl gave you
what was left of her power,

26:40.680 --> 26:42.440
so she couldn't wake up,

26:42.520 --> 26:44.360
but if you destroy
your own spiritual channel,

26:44.880 --> 26:47.120
the Chaos Power will return to her.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.720
However, in doing so,

26:50.960 --> 26:53.000
you will die.

26:53.680 --> 26:55.320
Completely.

26:56.560 --> 26:57.800
In my mind,

26:58.680 --> 27:00.440
it's not a reborn

27:02.200 --> 27:03.720
but an exchange.

27:04.400 --> 27:05.760
I can save her

27:06.520 --> 27:07.360
by destroying my own spiritual channel.

27:12.120 --> 27:13.720
Did you hear

27:13.800 --> 27:15.120
what I said?

27:15.920 --> 27:17.000
Yes.

27:18.080 --> 27:19.240
Very clearly.

27:20.280 --> 27:21.360
I am merely

27:22.440 --> 27:25.200
returning to her what is rightfully hers.

27:26.960 --> 27:28.800
Anyone who crosses
the Divine Execution Platform

27:29.960 --> 27:31.400
is an idiot.

27:40.520 --> 27:41.880
When I die,

27:43.280 --> 27:44.960
the Chaos Power will return to Ling,

27:47.360 --> 27:48.840
so where will my soul go?

27:49.440 --> 27:50.760
A normal person's soul

27:50.840 --> 27:52.560
will dissipate completely in this world,

27:55.360 --> 27:56.440
but

27:57.240 --> 27:59.800
yours seems to have
survived for 10,000 years,

27:59.880 --> 28:02.120
so it might go somewhere else.

28:02.720 --> 28:04.920
I have a soul that remains in the world.

28:05.000 --> 28:08.200
You are just a tiny fragment of me
remaining in the human realm.

28:09.000 --> 28:11.080
Is my soul really connected
to the Fallen Deity?

28:26.680 --> 28:28.120
Why are you doing this?

28:28.200 --> 28:30.360
I'm using the Jade Vault Technique
to place limits on my soul.

28:31.760 --> 28:34.600
If my soul is captured
by an outlaw after I die,

28:34.680 --> 28:36.120
they will not be able to do evil

28:36.200 --> 28:38.040
with this limitation.

28:38.120 --> 28:39.840
The world should have been at peace.

28:45.400 --> 28:46.560
Ling.

28:48.520 --> 28:50.720
I return all this to you.

29:18.920 --> 29:20.080
That's him.

29:36.760 --> 29:37.800
I told you

29:39.200 --> 29:40.480
you'd come back.

30:27.440 --> 30:28.800
Xie Xuechen.

30:28.880 --> 30:30.840
So, it was you all along.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.600
You

30:33.320 --> 30:35.360
are Mister,

30:37.800 --> 30:39.800
and since you have given me your life,

30:41.720 --> 30:43.280
I will guard the human world

30:44.920 --> 30:46.760
you love for you.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.720
If I accidentally die

30:52.560 --> 30:54.120
one day,

30:56.000 --> 30:57.600
I'll be able to see you.

30:59.560 --> 31:00.680
When that time comes,

31:02.760 --> 31:04.000
don't blame me.

31:07.680 --> 31:08.920
Xie Xuechen.

31:12.560 --> 31:13.720
Xie Xuechen.

31:17.240 --> 31:19.000
You left me alone again.

31:23.840 --> 31:25.200
You're finally back.

31:49.760 --> 31:51.200
Nan Xuyue.

31:56.840 --> 31:58.520
How dare you show up again?

31:59.760 --> 32:02.400
It was Xie Xuechen's fate

32:02.480 --> 32:03.880
to die in exchange for your rebirth.

32:04.480 --> 32:05.800
Don't use fate as an excuse.

32:05.880 --> 32:09.920
If you hadn't planned
to kill him with Immortals Array,

32:10.560 --> 32:12.200
how could he have traded
his life for mine?

32:12.920 --> 32:14.240
For all of this,

32:14.320 --> 32:16.160
it's time to put an end to it.

32:23.880 --> 32:25.920
You want to avenge Xie Xuechen,

32:26.000 --> 32:27.560
but not now.

32:28.160 --> 32:31.160
Your body is weak

32:31.240 --> 32:32.080
from the Immortals Array breach.

32:32.960 --> 32:35.000
Also, you just regained the Chaos Power,

32:35.080 --> 32:36.640
so you're not very skilled
at utilizing it.

32:36.720 --> 32:37.720
Your Chaos Power should

32:38.320 --> 32:40.120
be equal to mine,

32:40.960 --> 32:42.160
but at this moment,

32:44.280 --> 32:45.480
you have no chance of winning.

32:46.440 --> 32:47.880
You are not Nan Xuyue.

32:49.640 --> 32:50.680
Who are you?

32:55.360 --> 32:57.360
It seems that regaining the Chaos Power

32:58.280 --> 33:00.400
still hasn't brought back your memories.

33:02.480 --> 33:03.680
It doesn't matter

33:04.280 --> 33:05.440
if you've forgotten me.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.640
Let me introduce myself again.

33:20.640 --> 33:21.520
I am

33:22.880 --> 33:23.760
fate.

33:29.320 --> 33:32.080
You've been in a tough place
like Snow Cliff long enough.

33:33.200 --> 33:34.200
I'm taking you home.

33:45.600 --> 33:46.600
Why did you bring me here?

33:57.320 --> 33:59.080
You and I began in the Foreworld

34:00.000 --> 34:01.400
and were born in Chaos.

34:03.480 --> 34:05.720
We've been together for tens
of thousands of years in the divine realm

34:07.560 --> 34:09.800
and lived only with each other,

34:11.040 --> 34:13.480
and now you don't want to talk to me

34:14.960 --> 34:16.679
and even think I'm an enemy.

34:19.040 --> 34:20.880
It's ironic.

34:23.360 --> 34:24.800
I don't remember

34:25.960 --> 34:27.120
any of this.

34:28.760 --> 34:30.199
All I remember

34:34.440 --> 34:36.040
is that you killed Xie Xuechen.

34:41.679 --> 34:42.840
It's OK if you don't remember.

34:44.679 --> 34:46.400
Fate can't be changed.

34:49.239 --> 34:50.880
No matter what the process is,

34:52.280 --> 34:54.760
the result is the same.

34:55.800 --> 34:57.560
The others are just a moment in time

34:58.360 --> 34:59.920
for you and me.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.920
Only you and I are connected

35:04.640 --> 35:05.800
for eternity.

35:06.560 --> 35:07.960
I'm just Mu Xuanling,

35:09.240 --> 35:10.480
and I never believe in fate.

35:12.800 --> 35:14.200
Some moments are long,

35:16.080 --> 35:17.200
but some long periods

35:18.360 --> 35:19.680
are just a moment.

35:21.120 --> 35:23.120
What matters is who I'm with.

35:24.880 --> 35:26.440
I never cared about eternity

35:30.040 --> 35:31.960
and will never be with you.

35:43.560 --> 35:45.160
I've heard that in this world,

35:46.080 --> 35:47.600
when two people get married,

35:48.680 --> 35:50.800
it'll be for life.

35:53.040 --> 35:54.160
Today is the day

35:55.600 --> 35:57.680
you and I are reunited,

36:01.200 --> 36:02.880
and it's a perfect time.

36:05.000 --> 36:06.440
It is a good day

36:07.680 --> 36:08.960
for us to be married.

36:10.000 --> 36:11.320
I refuse.

36:12.920 --> 36:15.120
All I think about

36:16.240 --> 36:17.280
is Xie Xuechen.

36:19.200 --> 36:20.400
Whether I live or die,

36:22.160 --> 36:24.680
I only do it for Xie Xuechen.

36:43.560 --> 36:44.960
Our marriage doesn't depend

36:45.680 --> 36:47.520
on whether you want it or not.

36:49.520 --> 36:50.360
Because you

36:54.640 --> 36:55.880
don't have a choice.

37:03.480 --> 37:05.320
Two Realms Mountain has an anomaly.

37:05.400 --> 37:06.680
The demonic energy is so strong.

37:06.760 --> 37:09.320
It seems a new demon
has been born in this world.

37:10.680 --> 37:11.800
I've never seen

37:12.840 --> 37:14.600
such a strange phenomenon
in all my years of cultivation.

37:16.960 --> 37:18.440
But the Void Sea has been sealed,

37:18.520 --> 37:20.640
and the Immortals Array
has been rebuilt, so have we

37:21.280 --> 37:22.800
missed someone from the Dark Clan?

37:28.920 --> 37:31.680
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

37:31.760 --> 37:32.600
Such powerful demonic energy does not come

37:32.680 --> 37:34.440
from ordinary ones of the Dark Clan.

37:34.520 --> 37:36.440
I'm afraid it's far stronger
than Sang Qi's.

37:36.520 --> 37:39.200
That's impossible.
I've been to the Dark Abyss many times,

37:39.280 --> 37:40.760
but I've never seen
anyone stronger than Sang Qi.

37:45.560 --> 37:47.000
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

37:55.600 --> 37:57.240
Who are you?

38:11.760 --> 38:12.920
Xie Xuechen?

38:14.400 --> 38:15.960
Now that the sects are without a leader,

38:16.480 --> 38:17.880
and the Dark Abyss
may cause trouble again,

38:17.960 --> 38:19.840
the sects of the Immortal Alliance
should work together.

38:23.040 --> 38:25.080
Everyone, gather your elite disciples

38:25.160 --> 38:27.200
and go with me to Two Realms Mountain
to find out what's going on.

38:27.280 --> 38:28.480
Yes.

38:37.280 --> 38:38.400
Bao.

38:40.800 --> 38:43.120
Are you going

38:43.200 --> 38:44.440
with them?

38:57.400 --> 38:58.760
Stay in Snow City

38:58.840 --> 38:59.880
and wait for me.

39:00.480 --> 39:03.880
Be safe.

39:09.440 --> 39:14.280
I'm speaking for my mom.

39:15.440 --> 39:18.560
She's waiting for you.

39:21.560 --> 39:22.600
OK.

39:23.600 --> 39:25.440
How dare you come to the Dark Abyss again?

39:25.520 --> 39:26.600
Good.

39:26.680 --> 39:28.840
Then, let's have a good fight today.

39:28.920 --> 39:30.440
I'll make you a corpse

39:30.520 --> 39:31.560
before you get out of here.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.760
Why can you use demonic power?

39:42.200 --> 39:43.600
Trap him with Prison of Lust.

39:56.320 --> 39:57.800
You overestimated yourselves.

39:59.440 --> 40:04.640
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

40:08.200 --> 40:09.600
You're afraid?

40:11.600 --> 40:13.080
A warrior's destiny

40:13.960 --> 40:15.920
is either victory or death.

40:16.840 --> 40:18.640
And those who are cowardly in battle

40:18.720 --> 40:20.280
deserve to die.

40:20.360 --> 40:21.280
Who are you?

40:22.680 --> 40:23.680
I am

40:24.680 --> 40:25.600
Zhao Ming.

40:27.160 --> 40:28.960
You are the Fallen Deity
who was suppressed in the Lava Chasm?

40:29.040 --> 40:30.080
You are still alive?

40:32.600 --> 40:35.120
I don't want to hear
the word "the Fallen Deity" again.

40:35.840 --> 40:37.280
Next time,

40:37.960 --> 40:38.880
you die.

40:44.080 --> 40:46.080
It's time to change
the rules of the Dark Abyss.

40:46.160 --> 40:47.440
From this moment on,

40:47.960 --> 40:50.120
it's no longer the law of the jungle.

40:52.640 --> 40:54.440
It's the law of me.

40:55.040 --> 40:56.640
Those who obey me

40:57.320 --> 40:58.560
live.

40:59.240 --> 41:01.880
Those who fight me die.

41:14.720 --> 41:16.400
Long live the Demon Lord.

41:24.160 --> 41:25.680
Ten thousand years have passed,

41:26.640 --> 41:28.160
and my old friend is waiting for me.

41:29.400 --> 41:31.040
It's time to catch up.

41:42.680 --> 41:45.240
Master. Miss Mu won't change.

41:45.320 --> 41:47.080
We've been persuading her for a long time.

41:48.000 --> 41:48.880
It's all right.

41:49.560 --> 41:50.760
Leave us alone.

41:50.840 --> 41:51.840
Yes.

42:04.080 --> 42:05.320
You've gone mad.

42:06.840 --> 42:08.080
I'm sober.

42:09.560 --> 42:11.520
I know you don't want
to wear a wedding dress

42:12.080 --> 42:14.120
because you want to mourn for Xie Xuechen.

42:15.760 --> 42:17.120
I won't force you.

42:17.640 --> 42:19.240
If you wear all black and white,

42:19.320 --> 42:21.360
I will too.

42:21.440 --> 42:23.320
That would be a good match.

42:25.040 --> 42:26.160
Since you're fate,

42:27.040 --> 42:29.560
how can you believe in mortal marriage?

42:32.560 --> 42:33.600
Of course, I don't believe in it,

42:35.040 --> 42:36.240
but I know

42:37.360 --> 42:40.600
you've always wanted to have
this ceremony with Xie Xuechen

42:41.200 --> 42:43.240
and hold hands with him

42:44.480 --> 42:46.080
in the presence of heaven and earth

42:49.000 --> 42:50.600
until you die.

42:53.400 --> 42:55.920
I can give you
what Xie Xuechen can give you.

42:57.320 --> 43:00.320
I don't need you to love me,
but just to be there for me.

43:06.400 --> 43:07.680
The future is long,

43:08.480 --> 43:11.800
so I just hope we can
always be there for each other.
